{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/extras/6ef7b526151f5c4dee6c8554d9949e5d.avif?t=1759825374\" width=1200 height=153 /></span>Medieval intrigue, conspiracies, and songs by lamplight\u2014prepare for a unique visual novel where every pivotal moment is brought to life with a musical number!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/extras/c0383c2bed1b8ebe79fa27dfe77957df.poster.avif?t=1759825374\" width=780 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/extras/c0383c2bed1b8ebe79fa27dfe77957df.webm?t=1759825374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/extras/c0383c2bed1b8ebe79fa27dfe77957df.mp4?t=1759825374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u201cThe Canary\u201d is an engrossing visual novel that immerses you in the world of a medieval convent, full of secrets, intrigue, and unexpected twists of fate. The heroine, after a quiet and uneventful life, suddenly finds herself in an unfamiliar body and setting, where she must face realities she had only ever imagined. Your task is to help her navigate these new circumstances and uncover the mysteries hidden behind the convent walls. <br><br>In the game, you\u2019ll explore daily life in the convent, where routine duties\u2014singing in the choir, tending the garden, and cleaning\u2014serve only as a backdrop for deeper, more thrilling events. Behind the gray routine lurk dark secrets and schemes, and it\u2019s up to you to discover what is truly going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/extras/3bb106980a2b1fcd0aeed98191e82c74.avif?t=1759825374\" width=1200 height=153 /></span>\u2022 An original soundtrack in a medieval style, including vocal pieces<br>\u2022 A multi-layered relationship system where allies may turn out to be traitors<br>\u2022 A pleasant hand-drawn visual style<br>\u2022 Interactive scenes with mini-games reflecting everyday monastic tasks<br>\u2022 A nonlinear story with five unique endings<br>\u2022 A light, cozy, uplifting 6\u20138 hour adventure based on the book by Kira Strike</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953140?t=1759825374","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/844578aa2627f7c6690706136fec6afded9f17f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759825374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/c8496ce8b4671cf8c724d58272094f22fc55e678/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759825374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/c8496ce8b4671cf8c724d58272094f22fc55e678/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759825374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953140/extras/6ef7b526151f5c4dee6c8554d9949e5d.avif?t=1759825374\" width=